## {{ seed.plans.consumer.premium.name }} plan coverage

- Includes all registered specialties: {{ seed.specialties.general_practice.name | lower }}, {{ seed.specialties.psychology.name | lower }}, {{ seed.specialties.nutrition.name | lower }}, {{ seed.specialties.dermatology.name | lower }}, {{ seed.specialties.pediatrics.name | lower }}, {{ seed.specialties.cardiology.name | lower }}, and {{ seed.specialties.endocrinology.name | lower }}.
